=== Week 2: Viral Hits Night ===
Each couple performed one unlearned dance to a song that went [[Viral phenomenon|viral]] on [[social media]].<ref name="Week2PR">{{Cite press release |title=The Ballroom Goes Viral! ''Dancing with the Stars'' Celebrates the Biggest Hits on 'Viral Hits Night' on ABC and Disney+ |date=September 18, 2026 |publisher=[[American Broadcasting Company|ABC]] |url=https://www.detpress.com/abc/pressrelease/the-ballroom-goes-viral-dancing-with-the-stars-celebrates-the-biggest-hits-on-viral-hits-night-on-abc-and-disney/ |via=[[Disney General Entertainment Content Press]] |access-date=September 18, 2026 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260918210355/https://www.detpress.com/abc/pressrelease/the-ballroom-goes-viral-dancing-with-the-stars-celebrates-the-biggest-hits-on-viral-hits-night-on-abc-and-disney/ |archive-date=September 18, 2026}}</ref> The opening number, choreographed and performed by the troupe, was set to "[[Lush Life (Zara Larsson song)|Lush Life]]" by [[Zara Larsson]].<ref name="Week2People">{{Cite news |last=Kratofil |first=Colleen |date=September 22, 2026 |title=''Dancing with the Stars'' Recap: 1 Star Gets Sent Home on Viral Hits Night After Breaking Down in Tears at Practice |url=https://people.com/dancing-with-the-stars-live-updates-viral-hits-night-12135518 |access-date=September 22, 2026 |work=[[People (magazine)|People]]|archive-url=https://megalodon.jp/2026-0923-2324-53/https://people.com:443/dancing-with-the-stars-live-updates-viral-hits-night-12135518|archive-date=September 23, 2026|url-status=live}}</ref> [[Adele Zaikman]] and [[Hailey Bills]] performed a [[Samba (ballroom dance)|samba]] bumper to "[[Mi Chico]]" by DJ Goja.<ref name="Week2People" /> Music producer [[Harrison (English musician)|Harrison]] performed his cover of "[[All the Things She Said]]" for [[Amber Glenn]]'s [[tango]].<ref name="Week2People" /> The troupe later performed a tango routine to "[[Talking Body]]" by [[Tove Lo]].<ref name="Week2People" />

